@SolidClass base(Targetname, PhysWheelKeys) = func_vehicle_wheel : "Vehicle wheel from brushes, needs an origin brush at the centre of its axle. A point of a vehicle's collision shape, with wheel properties.

Bmodel wheels are strongly recommended to have their axle along X axis, with angle set to the func_vehicle's angle +-90, for wobble-free spinning!" []

@PointClass base(Angle, Targetname) size(-4 -4 -4, 4 4 4) color(0 200 255) studio(model) = phys_static : "Visible vehicle part, or an enter/exit marker.

Does not affect the physics, just for decoration or gameplay separate from the physics simulation."
[
	model(studio) : "Model" : : "Model to show"
